  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Attack**: Play 1, 3, or 5 cards. 1 = any card. 3 = pair + third (e.g. 7-7-9). 5 = two pairs + fifth (e.g. K-K-4-4-7). 2. **Defend**: Beat each attack card with a higher same-suit card, or any trump on non-trump. Trump beats trump only with higher trump. 3. **Result**: Beat all â†’ defender attacks next. Unbeaten â†’ defender picks up those cards; attacker attacks again. 4. **Draw**: After each battle, both draw to 5 from stock (attacker first). 5. **Endgame**: When stock empty, no draws. Cannot attack with more cards than opponent holds. First to empty hand wins.',
    Player: '1. **Attack**: Play 1, 3, or 5 cards. 1 = any card. 3 = pair + third (e.g. 7-7-9). 5 = two pairs + fifth (e.g. K-K-4-4-7). 2. **Defend**: Beat each attack card with a higher same-suit card, or any trump on non-trump. Trump beats trump only with higher trump. 3. **Result**: Beat all â†’ defender attacks next. Unbeaten â†’ defender picks up those cards; attacker attacks again. 4. **Draw**: After each battle, both draw to 5 from stock (attacker first). 5. **Endgame**: When stock empty, no draws. Cannot attack with more cards than opponent holds. First to empty hand wins.',
    objective: 'Empty your hand before your opponent. The player left with cards when the other goes out loses.',
    gameplay: '1. **Attack**: Play 1, 3, or 5 cards. 1 = any card. 3 = pair + third (e.g. 7-7-9). 5 = two pairs + fifth (e.g. K-K-4-4-7). 2. **Defend**: Beat each attack card with a higher same-suit card, or any trump on non-trump. Trump beats trump only with higher trump. 3. **Result**: Beat all â†’ defender attacks next. Unbeaten â†’ defender picks up those cards; attacker attacks again. 4. **Draw**: After each battle, both draw to 5 from stock (attacker first). 5. **Endgame**: When stock empty, no draws. Cannot attack with more cards than opponent holds. First to empty hand wins.',
    keyRules: [
      'Beat with higher same suit, or any trump on non-trump; higher trump on trump.',
      'Defender may choose to pick up any cards instead of beating.',
      'Cannot attack with more cards than opponent has.',
      'Trump indicator stays in place until stock drawn; no exchange for low trump (unlike Durak).',
      'Draw can end in tie if both empty in final battle.',
